# Cloudflare Web Analytics site token, from the Web Analytics dashboard for
# motedesktop.com. The site is prerendered, so this is read at build time and
# baked into the HTML — set it in the Cloudflare Pages build environment.
#
# Leave it unset and no analytics script is served at all, which is what a
# local `bun dev` and any fork should do.
VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=

# The feedback API Worker (worker/) keeps its configuration in Cloudflare, not
# here: its secrets are set with `wrangler secret put` and never live in the
# repository. See worker/README.md.
#
# The matching local values — the app token a desktop build is compiled with,
# and the admin token for reading reports — belong in an untracked
# `.env.worker.local`, which .gitignore already covers:
#
#   MOTE_FEEDBACK_APP_TOKEN=
#   MOTE_FEEDBACK_ADMIN_TOKEN=
#   MOTE_FEEDBACK_RATE_SALT=
